emo.Claw MachineWe’ve added a new minigame to the solarium! Jun can now rummage around in a planter full of leaves, trying to catch the spore bugs hiding inside while Loren watches. Each kind of bug gives you a different item: herbs, resin, stun grenades or molotovs. Catch a shimmering bug and you’ll get one of everything. We wanted to give you more opportunities to stock up during the day, so you don’t have to feel quite so precious abo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T05:18:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935403","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4970020-1845383656384593","game_id":"steam-4970020","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Beetle Battles and a whole lot more","summary":"Hey everyone! We just pushed a big update to the demo. Beetle battleThere's a new minigame in the solarium. You and Loren put two beetles on a stick and see who can get knocked off first. Beat her to unlock harder rounds and win to get the reward at the end.Loren's Combat Skill: Tennis BallHer Tennis Ball stuns whatever it hits now.CookingEach dish has a chili rating so you know how hard it is before you start. After breakfast you can go back and replay cooking as much as you want.Quality of lif","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T01:28:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384593","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4970020-1844751498226067","game_id":"steam-4970020","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: stalks","summary":"Thank you for all the feedback on the demo. This update is mostly about the pace of the night. Stalks Stalks show you where the next wave will come from, both in the house and on the tactical map. Once a stalk starts growing, you have three rounds to get ready before it bursts. Clear the board and the next wave comes straight in, so the night moves as fast as you do. Stalks pay out resin when they burst, and the faster you clear, the more you earn. Polish Fixed the camera sometimes following Lor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T22:27:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4970020-1844751498218716","game_id":"steam-4970020","kind":"announcement","title":"Nightbound Demo Out Now","summary":"Hey everyone,The Nightbound demo is out on Steam today! It runs on Windows, and it's the first three days and nights of the game.If this is your first look at Nightbound, it’s a turn-based tactics game about two strangers who share one house at the end of the world. They spend the days together and hold the house against the Bloom at night. The closer they get, the better they fight.What's in the demo:Days 1 to 3, from the moment Jun gets let in through the third night Turn-based tactics, built ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T15:03:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218716","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4970020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4970020":"2026-10-26T05:53:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4970020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5260270":{"l